SUMMARY:NAHJ Student Summit 2026
DESCRIPTION:Join us this spring for the NAHJ Student Summit\, a full-day experience designed to inform\, inspire\, and connect the next generation of journalists. Hosted by the NAHJ Student Chapter of UCF\, this summit will bring together students for engaging conversations\, skill-building sessions\, and opportunities to network with peers and professionals. \n🗓 Saturday\, April 18\, 2026\n⏰ 8:30 a.m. – 4:00 p.m.\n📍 Nicholson School of Communication and Media\n12405 Aquarius Agora Dr\, Orlando\, FL 32816 \n🎟 Free for students\n✅ Pre-registration required\n🔗 Register here \nWhether you’re just starting out or preparing to enter the industry\, this summit is a great chance to learn\, connect\, and grow within the NAHJ community. Here’s the schedule: \n8:30 a.m.\nWelcome and Opening Remarks \n9:00 a.m.\nLanding That First Job (Plenary) \n10:00 a.m.\nFrom Resume to Offer: Mastering the Job Search Game\nLatinos in the Sports World\nFreelancing 101: Building a Side Career in Journalism \n11:00 a.m.\nWhat If I Don’t Want to Do News?\nNew Media / Covering Your Campus Beat\nTourism\, Thrills & Telling the Story: Journalism in Orlando’s Theme Park Capital / Covering the Experience: Theme Parks\, Travel & Audience Engagement \n12:00 p.m. – 1:00 p.m.\nChat and Chew Lunch Plenary \n1:00 – 2:00 PM\nOvercoming Imposter Syndrome: Building Confidence and Owning Your Success (Sponsored by Bloomberg)\nHave you ever achieved success yet still felt like you didn’t truly earn it? The familiar advice to “fake it till you make it” can sometimes leave us questioning whether we actually belong. This experience—known as Imposter Syndrome—can undermine confidence\, limit growth\, and prevent individuals from fully embracing their accomplishments. In this workshop\, participants will explore the psychological roots of Imposter Syndrome\, learn to recognize its common signs and triggers\, and gain practical strategies to reframe self-doubt. Through guided reflection and actionable techniques\, attendees will build the confidence to internalize their achievements\, strengthen their professional presence\, and show up with greater authenticity. \n2:00 p.m. – 4:00 p.m.\nCareer Fair \nSponsors\n  \n \n  \n \n  \n \n 
URL:https://nahj.org/event/nahj-student-summit-2026/
LOCATION:Orlando\, Florida\, Nicholson School of Communication and Media\, 12405 Aquarius Agora Dr.\, Orlando\, FL\, 32816\, United States
CATEGORIES:Next Generation
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://nahj.org/wp-content/uploads/2026/01/Student-Summit-2026.jpg
END:VEVENT
